# Binaries exempted from the hardened_malloc preload.
#
# Managed by `steel-malloc exempt` / `steel-malloc unexempt`. One absolute path
# per line.
#
# This file is a record, not a mechanism: the exemption is implemented by a
# wrapper in /usr/local/bin that clears LD_PRELOAD. The list exists so that the
# exceptions are visible — an undocumented exemption is indistinguishable from
# a measure that quietly stopped working.
